This product includes a function-calling model that was trained on:

  * Mobile Actions dataset, Google, licensed under CC BY 4.0
    (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The queries and tool calls were used for
    training and for the evaluation numbers in the documentation. Changes were made: the
    data was filtered, augmented with query-form variants, and extended with paraphrases.

  * Paraphrases of the training queries that were generated with a large language model
    (Gemini 2.5 Flash Lite) and filtered automatically.

The model weights (downloaded separately from Hugging Face) are provided under CC BY 4.0, see README.md.
